    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362250/extras/f3a9212ace980df843ff8559c7de5194.avif?t=1743150255\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT TACTICAL VR is the single-player  VR extraction game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the special weapons collected across different maps to lighten the load of your missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic combat experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions on immersive battlefields using a variety of items based on real-world weapons and gear. Hold your gun with both hands, reload magazines, and pull the trigger. Use complex gun physics and injury and healing systems to escape the area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt and upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor and upgrade your arsenal to suit your playstyle from your home base with our modding system. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362250/extras/f3a9212ace980df843ff8559c7de5194.avif?t=1743150255\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOT TACTICAL VR is the single-player  VR extraction game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the special weapons collected across different maps to lighten the load of your missions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic combat experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions on immersive battlefields using a variety of items based on real-world weapons and gear. Hold your gun with both hands, reload magazines, and pull the trigger. Use complex gun physics and injury and healing systems to escape the area.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt and upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor and upgrade your arsenal to suit your playstyle from your home base with our modding system. </p>",
    "short_description": "NOT TACTICAL VR is the single-player VR extraction game. As a mercenary, you must loot, upgrade, and attack to survive and claim victory on the battlefield. Upgrade your character in a variety of ways, including buying weapons, looting, and earning rewards from missions.",
